Date":null,"slug":"asy","briefDescription":"\"Antayoshti Sahayata Yojana\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides ₹ 10,000/- for the last rites in the case of the death of the registered beneficiary. Only the residents/domicile of the state of Jharkhand can apply.","tags":["Financial Asisstance","Social Welfare","Construction Worker"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"tgKOyokBsSMYTfzi4d7n","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"PPY-JBOCWWB","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Social welfare & Empowerment","Banking,Financial Services and Insurance"],"schemeName":"Parivaar Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"ppy-jbocwwb","briefDescription":"\"Parivaar Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides 50% of the pension amount or a maximum of ₹ 500/- to the family members of the deceased pensioner.","tags":["Pension","Construction Worker","Family","Social Welfare"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"8AKOyokBsSMYTfzi192X","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"CPY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Health & Wellness","Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"Chikitsa Pratipoorti Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"cpy","briefDescription":"\"Chikitsa Pratipoorti Yojana\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides financial assistance to the Registered Workers for the treatment of serious illnesses (cancer, heart disease, kidney disease, etc.","tags":["Health","Disease","Financial Assistance","Construction Worker"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"EQyOyokBvvukECfi4ukl","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"PY-JBOCWWB","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance"],"schemeName":"Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"py-jbocwwb","briefDescription":"\"Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides pension of ₹ 1,000/- per month to those who have contributed to the JBOCWWB for at least 30 years.","tags":["Pension","Construction Worker","Financial Assistance"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"NQyOyokBvvukECfi1uh3","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"MPY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Health & Wellness"],"schemeName":"Matrutva Prasuvidha Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"mpy","briefDescription":"\"Matrutva Prasuvidha Yojana\" is a Medical Assistance scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides financial assistance of ₹ 15,000/- for the first two deliveries of the registered female worker.","tags":["Pregnancy","Women","Hospitalization"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"mQKOyokBsSMYTfzi4N62","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"CSY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Health & Wellness"],"schemeName":"Chikitsa Sahayata Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"csy","briefDescription":"\"Chikitsa Sahayata Yojana\" is a Medical Assistance scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides medical assistance to all registered workers who are admitted to the hospital for five or more working days.","tags":["Health","Hospitalization","Construction Worker","Financial Assistance"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"FgyOyokB1csUTixB2N_K","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"MPPCY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"Medhavi Putra/Putri Chhatravritti Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"mppcy","briefDescription":"\"Medhavi Putra/Putri Chhatravritti Yojana\" is a Scholarship Scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. This is a 100% State Sponsored Scheme. Only the residents/domicile of the state of Jharkhand can apply to this scheme.","tags":["Scholarship","Education","Student","Graduation","Postgraduation","School"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"LQKOyokBsSMYTfzi2t7-","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"NSSKY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Skills & Employment","Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"Nirman Shramik Safety Kit Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"nssky","briefDescription":"\"Nirman Shramik Safety Kit Yojana\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides a direct cash transfer of ₹ 1,000/- for purchasing a branded helmet and a pair of safety shoes.","tags":["Financial Asisstance","Construction Worker","Social Welfare"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"cAyOyokBvvukECfi2ujD","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"APY-JBOCWWB","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance","Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"Annath Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"apy-jbocwwb","briefDescription":"\"Annath Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. In case of the death of the pensioner, the pension will be payable at the rate of the family pension and will be evenly divided among orphans below 18 years of age.","tags":["Pension","Orphan","Construction Worker","Social Welfare","Financial Assistance"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"CwKRyokBsSMYTfzi0t_n","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"SASY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"Shramik Auzaar Sahayata Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"sasy","briefDescription":"\"Nirman Shramik Auzaar Sahayata Yojana\" is a Social Welfare Scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme is also known as \"Toolkit Assistance Scheme for Construction Workers\" in English. This is a 100% State Sponsored Scheme. ","tags":["Financial Asisstance","Social Welfare","Construction Worker","Citizen Empowerment"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"gAyOyokB1csUTixB3988","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"VSY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"Vivah Sahayata Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"vsy","briefDescription":"\"Vivah Sahayata Yojana\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides financial assistance of ₹ 30,000/- (Rupees Thirty Thousand Only) rupees for the marriage of two children / female members of the family.","tags":["Financial Assistance","Marriage","Social Welfare"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"wQKOyokBsSMYTfzi4t5E","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"NPY-JBOCWWB","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance","Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"Nishaktata Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"npy-jbocwwb","briefDescription":"\"Nishaktata Pension Yojana (JBOCWWB)\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides a pension of ₹ 1,000/- per month to the registered beneficiary who is permanently disabled due to paralysis/leprosy/tuberculosis/accident.","tags":["Pension","Disability","Construction Worker","Social Welfare"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"CgKRyokBsSMYTfzi0t-K","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"JNKMDSY","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"Jharkhand Nirman Karmakar Mrityu/Durghatana Sahayata Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"jnkmdsy","briefDescription":"\"Jharkhand Nirman Karmakar Mrityu/Durghatana Sahayata Yojana\" is a 100% State Sponsored scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. The scheme provides social security to all registered workers in the age group of 18-60 years.","tags":["Construction Worker","Social Welfare","Financial Assistance","Accident","Disability"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"FQKOyokBsSMYTfzi2t42","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Jharkhand"],"schemeShortTitle":"CSY-J","nodalMinistryName":null,"schemeCategory":["Skills & Employment","Social welfare & Empowerment","Women and Child"],"schemeName":"Cycle Sahayata Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"slug":"csy-j","briefDescription":"\"Cycle Sahayata Yojana\" is a scheme by the Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development Govt of Jharkhand. Applications for this scheme are accepted online through the official website of the department. In this scheme, bicycles are provided to the women workers.","tags":["Woman","Construction Worker","Social Welfare"]},"highlight":{}}],"page":{"total":14,"totalPages":1,"pageNumber":0,"from":0,"size":100}},"sortedBy":"multiple_sort"}}